type: software
title: "KAPPA: Kit of Agents for Proof-checking Papers with a proof Assistant"
abstract: >-
  KAPPA checks the proofs already written in a LaTeX paper by translating them
  step by step into Lean 4, with language model agents that review each
  other's work.
